This privacy policy pertains to Findroid+.

Findroid+ does not collect, sell, or share personal information. The app does not include analytics,
advertising, or tracking services.

Data entered into the app, such as server addresses, account details, and profile PINs, is stored on
the device and used only to connect to your Jellyfin server. Profile PINs are stored as salted
hashes. Media metadata and download state are stored locally so the app can work offline.

Requests to your Jellyfin server are made directly between the app and the server address you
provide. No project-operated server receives your data.

For privacy questions, open an issue at https://github.com/hdytrfli/findroid/issues.
